**Scope**: SCM & Manufacturing Modules (Procurement, Inventory, WMS, Manufacturing, Cost Management, EAM, TMS, PPM)
**Objective**: Identification of Mock Data, TODOs, Placeholders, and Unwired Components
**Evaluation**: Frontend UI/UX, Backend Architecture, Database Schema Parity against Oracle Fusion Cloud ERP

