### Architectural Conclusion
While the frontend UI forms and components perfectly mirror Oracle Fusion's granular layout (meeting the prior parity mandate), **the backend API and DB integration layer for several advanced SCM/MFG features is incomplete (unwired).** 
To achieve true 100% full-stack parity, **all identified mock dependencies must be replaced with Drizzle ORM mutations and TanStack Query endpoints.**

*Action: Commencing the build phase to resolve all identified mock data and unwired components.*
